# AI-hint: Hypr3D 3D->2D keyboard transition (applies after hypr3d-mios-room-input.patch): leaving the room always hands the keyboard to a window. deactivate3D re-focuses, after the layout restore, the window the room had focused at exit; when the room had no aim focus (a quick 0.15-0.4 s re-toggle, or the crosshair on the floor) the window that had the keyboard in 2D when the room opened (saved by enter3D, kept across a re-entry during the exit); then the newest still-shown window in Hyprland's focus history; then the newest window on the room's monitor. Visible workspace, mapped, not no_focus only; never under a session lock. Without it clearAimFocus leaves the desktop with no focused window and typed keys go nowhere.
